<title>FRANCE: Havas Advertising maintains profit goal.</title>
<headline>Havas Advertising maintains profit goal.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Havas Advertising's nine month sales were up 7.8 percent to 20.1 billion francs and would allow it to reach its profit target.</p>
<p>At a constant structure, sales were up 6.8 percent.</p>
<p>&quot;These figures underline once more the good performance of Havas Advertising, notably on foreign markets, which represent two-thirds of sales,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;These figures confirm the good perspectives for 1996. Havas Advertising should be able to meet its objectives in sales and profit terms.&quot;</p>
<p>The company was not available to comment on these objectives.</p>
<p>Havas Advertising is part of Havas.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452.</p>
</text>
